WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.440
EPISODE 34

01:48.200 --> 01:49.040
This…

01:49.600 --> 01:51.200
Is this a place to live?

01:51.280 --> 01:52.360
Zhuniang.

01:53.200 --> 01:55.160
Even the third-ranked scholar lived here.

01:55.240 --> 01:57.360
Who could be so picky not to?

01:58.440 --> 01:59.280
Hurry up,

01:59.360 --> 02:01.200
while there's still daylight.

02:01.280 --> 02:02.480
Claim a spot at Fude Temple.

02:03.080 --> 02:04.240
If you're late,

02:04.320 --> 02:07.240
the beggars won't move.

02:08.360 --> 02:10.640
In-law, don't be upset.

02:10.720 --> 02:12.720
There are only three rooms here.

02:12.800 --> 02:15.120
With such a big family,

02:15.200 --> 02:16.520
we probably can't all fit.

02:17.040 --> 02:19.080
Plus, we need servants,

02:19.160 --> 02:20.680
someone to fetch water and cook.

02:24.840 --> 02:27.400
Madam, just having shelter is a blessing.

02:28.040 --> 02:29.200
That's enough.

02:30.120 --> 02:32.280
These rooms are enough. We'll manage.

02:33.280 --> 02:35.320
That's more like it.

02:35.400 --> 02:38.360
The courtyard has a well and water jars.
Also, a kitchen with a stove.

02:38.440 --> 02:40.960
The house hasn't been used in years.

02:41.040 --> 02:43.440
Just clean the dust and cobwebs.

02:44.360 --> 02:46.760
It's getting late. Before dark,

02:46.840 --> 02:49.200
I'll send over some vegetables.

02:50.040 --> 02:51.240
Thank you for your care.

02:51.320 --> 02:53.680
Don't mention it. We'll leave now.
You clean up first.

02:58.920 --> 03:00.560
Master, let me help you.

03:00.640 --> 03:01.840
No need. Go fetch water.

03:01.920 --> 03:02.840
- But I…
- Okay.

03:15.120 --> 03:16.960
All right, all right, let's go.

03:17.040 --> 03:18.880
- Heading back.
- Wait.

03:18.960 --> 03:19.800
- Don't look.
- Mom.

03:19.880 --> 03:20.800
- I--
- Let's go.

03:27.880 --> 03:29.920
The Yang's are royal relatives
by the maternal line.

03:30.400 --> 03:32.200
Despite the bride-snatching incident,

03:32.280 --> 03:33.840
they've done no major wrongs.

03:33.920 --> 03:36.200
As for cheap acquiring of lands,

03:36.280 --> 03:38.760
it was the Zhang family who wanted
to sell the property urgently

03:39.360 --> 03:40.960
to fund a dowry.

03:41.560 --> 03:43.160
So, the Yangs bought it at a lower price.

03:43.840 --> 03:46.920
It was mutual agreement.
No one has complained.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.960
But their son-in-law exposed it
and filed the case.

03:49.880 --> 03:51.640
Many officials rent homes

03:51.720 --> 03:53.000
in the capital.

03:53.080 --> 03:54.000
Someone even

03:54.080 --> 03:56.920
wrote a poem at the Censorate.

03:58.440 --> 03:59.800
What poem?

04:00.680 --> 04:02.840
Serving here for 20 springs,

04:03.480 --> 04:05.640
I've no place to call my own.

04:06.480 --> 04:08.920
I envy snails with homes to hide,

04:09.000 --> 04:11.600
unlike rats in borrowed dens.

04:12.320 --> 04:13.880
I get it.

04:13.960 --> 04:15.400
The rat

04:16.120 --> 04:17.320
means the Yang family.

04:18.040 --> 04:19.960
They made their fortune in trade.

04:20.040 --> 04:22.040
Their ancestors left many properties.

04:22.120 --> 04:24.680
But bad timing. Lady Jieyu
was involved in the Queen's overthrow.

04:25.520 --> 04:27.240
Officials turned against them en masse.

04:27.320 --> 04:29.120
Minor faults became serious crimes.

04:29.200 --> 04:31.880
To appease the public,
without investigation,

04:31.960 --> 04:33.480
His Majesty seized the Yang estate.

04:33.560 --> 04:35.480
That's it? Just confiscated?

04:35.560 --> 04:37.280
Isn't that unfair?

04:38.560 --> 04:41.160
Madam, now's not the time
for them to seek justice.

04:41.760 --> 04:44.320
To avoid further trouble,
convince Leshan to divorce.

04:45.120 --> 04:47.520
No way. When they were powerful,

04:47.600 --> 04:49.560
you didn't push for divorce.

04:49.640 --> 04:52.480
Now they're struggling,
you rush in to cut ties?

04:52.560 --> 04:54.480
What would people think of Leshan?

04:54.560 --> 04:56.040
Even we would face ridicule.

04:56.640 --> 04:59.920
Divorcing now would bring criticism.

05:00.000 --> 05:01.400
It'd ruin Leshan's reputation.

05:01.480 --> 05:03.200
But if she doesn't divorce,

05:03.280 --> 05:06.080
her life with a scoundrel will be tragic.

05:06.160 --> 05:07.200
Is that fair?

05:08.800 --> 05:10.000
What should we do?

05:11.320 --> 05:12.560
Yangxi,

05:13.400 --> 05:14.760
what do you think?

05:19.000 --> 05:19.840
Madam,

05:20.360 --> 05:21.800
I sense

05:21.880 --> 05:23.600
the Yang family's woes aren't over.

05:24.640 --> 05:25.800
Let us know your decision.

05:25.880 --> 05:28.360
So we can plan accordingly.

05:36.200 --> 05:37.800
Here are ten strings.

05:37.880 --> 05:39.400
I borrowed them from my mom.

05:39.480 --> 05:42.600
No private loans or gambling.

05:42.680 --> 05:44.240
Run an honest business.

05:44.880 --> 05:45.840
You have one month.

05:45.920 --> 05:48.640
Make triple profit and I will consider you
winning the third round.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.320
Still keeping your promise?

05:59.520 --> 06:01.080
In front of bandits,

06:01.160 --> 06:02.720
you saved my family's lives.

06:03.280 --> 06:05.640
I still owe you.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.200
If you can earn triple profit

06:11.280 --> 06:12.760
in a month,

06:12.840 --> 06:14.720
I will follow you, even if you decide

06:14.800 --> 06:16.920
to sell wine by day or tea at night.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.320
Enduring every hardship,

06:19.320 --> 06:21.520
I, Li Leshan, will honor my promise.

06:24.800 --> 06:26.360
I'll keep my word.

06:27.320 --> 06:28.200
No matter what.

06:45.560 --> 06:46.520
Fool.

06:51.280 --> 06:52.680
Take a look here.

06:54.160 --> 06:55.680
Isn't it good?

06:56.920 --> 06:58.000
Okay.

06:58.080 --> 06:59.160
Your business is good.

07:02.000 --> 07:02.920
Come here.

07:04.080 --> 07:06.680
Steamed buns, freshly made.

07:07.600 --> 07:08.480
Come take a look.

07:08.560 --> 07:11.160
They are all sturdy and durable.

07:13.880 --> 07:15.000
My fruits are sweet.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.560
You say our fruits are expensive?

07:16.640 --> 07:17.920
- None are cheap.
- I want this.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.880
- Try this.
- I want that.

07:19.960 --> 07:21.720
- Sure.
- Okay.

07:21.800 --> 07:22.640
Nice taste.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.400
This one is the sweetest now.

07:24.480 --> 07:25.400
Come back later.

07:25.480 --> 07:27.440
- Take it.
- Be careful.

07:36.880 --> 07:37.920
What are you doing?

07:40.720 --> 07:41.600
Why are you here?

07:42.280 --> 07:43.800
Just made some locust leaf noodles.

07:43.880 --> 07:45.400
This one's for your husband.

07:45.480 --> 07:47.720
Mom added extra shrimp for him.

07:49.040 --> 07:50.280
Here, take it.

07:58.800 --> 08:00.960
Shouhua sent you to snoop, didn't she?

08:01.040 --> 08:02.680
Still mad?

08:03.480 --> 08:04.920
They want you to divorce him.

08:05.000 --> 08:07.080
They've thought it through carefully.

08:07.160 --> 08:09.560
You'll understand someday, kid.

08:10.320 --> 08:11.480
Go inside.

08:12.520 --> 08:14.040
- I'm leaving.
- Let's go.

08:15.680 --> 08:16.560
Well…

08:17.680 --> 08:19.920
Let's go. Move.

08:46.840 --> 08:47.840
Leshan.

08:47.920 --> 08:50.320
- What's in the jar?
- Lychees.

08:50.920 --> 08:53.400
My brother says fresh lychees
don't profit much.

08:53.480 --> 08:55.240
We had a southern cook once.

08:55.320 --> 08:57.120
Unused summer lychees

08:57.200 --> 08:59.840
were brined with hibiscus salt plum.

08:59.920 --> 09:01.680
They stayed good for months.

09:01.760 --> 09:03.360
We sold them to travelers later

09:03.440 --> 09:05.920
and earned 20% more profit.

09:06.520 --> 09:09.360
Where's Yang Xian? Mom sent noodles.

09:10.640 --> 09:13.040
- Perfect, I'm starving.
- Mind your manners.

09:14.960 --> 09:16.320
You've had a long day.

09:16.400 --> 09:18.560
Wait here. I'll get you some tea.

09:20.280 --> 09:21.640
She's changed.

09:22.520 --> 09:24.880
Xian scolds us every day.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.480
He says anyone who disobeys him

09:26.560 --> 09:28.160
gets sent back to the countryside.

09:29.400 --> 09:31.800
He even orders his own dad around.

09:32.440 --> 09:33.640
What an ungrateful son.

09:33.720 --> 09:36.080
So, what's wrong with that?

09:36.160 --> 09:38.280
Spoils concubines, cruel to kin.

09:38.360 --> 09:40.240
You've been twisted for 20 years.

09:40.320 --> 09:42.120
Welcomes thieves, invites wolves.

09:42.720 --> 09:44.760
Squandered the family's fortune.

09:45.560 --> 09:46.920
If you had some guts,

09:47.000 --> 09:49.240
you'd beg on the streets.

09:49.320 --> 09:52.360
Stop leeching off my son for food.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.520
Get back to work.

09:59.240 --> 10:01.320
Mom, take a break.

10:08.760 --> 10:11.400
Aren't you helping with salted lychees?
What are you doing here?

10:12.000 --> 10:14.200
Lychee sales are great this season.

10:14.280 --> 10:16.000
But it's not sustainable.

10:16.560 --> 10:19.080
I met a failed scholar
from Huzhou on my way home.

10:19.680 --> 10:21.760
He brought a type of southern gauze.

10:21.840 --> 10:23.280
It's cheap but has no buyers.

10:24.000 --> 10:24.840
I had an idea.

10:24.920 --> 10:26.400
What if it's used for office hats?

10:26.480 --> 10:29.160
It's smoother and softer
than regular gauze.

10:29.800 --> 10:31.640
So, I went to Hat Alley

10:31.720 --> 10:34.520
and ordered 100 hats from a workshop.

10:35.240 --> 10:36.520
But…

10:37.080 --> 10:39.800
how do we get the officials in Bianjing

10:39.880 --> 10:41.120
to wear these hats?

10:43.960 --> 10:45.720
If my brother-in-law wears one,

10:45.800 --> 10:47.120
it'll catch on easily.

10:48.240 --> 10:50.200
Too bad I can't ask him myself.

10:52.560 --> 10:53.680
Eat first.

11:45.680 --> 11:47.080
Shouhua.

11:51.560 --> 11:53.640
If Leshan still hates him,

11:53.720 --> 11:55.600
I'll stay out of it.

11:55.680 --> 11:56.560
But I think…

11:59.320 --> 12:00.720
Do we really need to send him away?

12:01.360 --> 12:04.160
Leshan is fiery but compassionate.

12:05.000 --> 12:07.280
She'd bring home stray birds and dogs.

12:08.000 --> 12:09.960
She's always soft-hearted.

12:10.560 --> 12:13.920
The worse Yang Xian gets,
the more pity she feels.

12:14.800 --> 12:17.600
Wealthy life is easy.

12:17.680 --> 12:20.400
But poor couples struggle daily.

12:20.480 --> 12:23.120
She's never worried about food or clothes.

12:23.200 --> 12:24.680
How would she understand hardship?

12:40.000 --> 12:42.800
It's definitely lighter than gauze.

12:42.880 --> 12:44.400
And it feels much softer too.

12:45.000 --> 12:45.840
Fine.

12:46.600 --> 12:48.280
I'll take all the caps you have.

12:48.360 --> 12:50.000
Fifty coins each. Deal?

12:52.600 --> 12:55.360
Thank you, Master Qiao. Thank you!

12:57.400 --> 12:58.720
Master Qiao has sharp eyes.

12:58.800 --> 13:01.000
I'm so grateful for your support.

13:01.680 --> 13:05.840
But a gauze cap in the capital
costs a thousand.

13:06.640 --> 13:08.120
They're made with quality materials.

13:08.200 --> 13:10.640
In Luoyang,
they're worth 200 to 300 coins.

13:11.240 --> 13:13.760
Fifty coins each is way too cheap.
I'd lose money.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.840
I can sell them for 800 or 1,000 coins.

13:15.920 --> 13:17.280
I have my way to do it.

13:17.360 --> 13:19.720
If these sit unsold,

13:19.800 --> 13:21.720
they're worthless to you.

13:23.800 --> 13:25.960
Master…

13:28.240 --> 13:29.920
we've been here seven days.

13:30.600 --> 13:31.680
And we've only sold one.

13:32.800 --> 13:34.600
Don't forget, we have a one-month wager.

13:35.840 --> 13:37.080
We're running out of time.

13:38.480 --> 13:41.040
People prefer gauze caps these days.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.920
Selling these

13:44.000 --> 13:45.480
will take serious effort.

13:45.560 --> 13:47.000
Master Yang,

13:47.760 --> 13:49.600
I know what happened to you.

13:49.680 --> 13:51.480
I admire your determination.

13:51.560 --> 13:52.880
I'd like to work with you.

13:52.960 --> 13:55.640
Eighty coins each. I'll take them all.

13:55.720 --> 13:58.320
But you can't sell to anyone else.

14:01.560 --> 14:03.480
Fine, we'll do it your way.

14:04.920 --> 14:05.960
Great.

14:08.040 --> 14:10.560
I just stocked up on goods recently.

14:11.160 --> 14:12.920
I don't have much silver left.

14:13.000 --> 14:14.800
I'm leaving the capital tonight.

14:14.880 --> 14:16.320
It's getting late already.

14:16.400 --> 14:19.120
Come with me to the inn for the rest.

14:19.200 --> 14:22.920
Then send some men to load the goods.

14:23.000 --> 14:23.960
My ship's at the dock.

14:24.040 --> 14:25.760
It's the one with Qiao on the bow.

14:26.680 --> 14:27.520
So, what do you say?

14:28.640 --> 14:30.800
Master.

14:33.240 --> 14:35.520
Thanks for your support. We'll do it.

14:45.200 --> 14:46.320
Coming, coming.

14:55.720 --> 14:56.560
Try this.

14:57.120 --> 14:58.000
Do you want this?

14:58.960 --> 15:02.120
Here, Yangxi, try some.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.200
Madam.

15:04.400 --> 15:06.840
Lianghan, take this.

15:06.920 --> 15:09.120
I grilled this fish myself. Try it.

15:09.720 --> 15:10.760
Thanks, Madam.

15:12.520 --> 15:15.280
Mom, let's call Leshan to eat.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.680
Just eat your food.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.480
By the way,

15:19.560 --> 15:21.560
Chai An brought grape wine yesterday.

15:21.640 --> 15:23.560
I chilled it in the well.

15:23.640 --> 15:25.440
Bring it out to share.

15:26.040 --> 15:27.440
It's been days.

15:27.520 --> 15:29.720
Leshan's still upset with us.

15:29.800 --> 15:31.880
I saved some dishes she loves.

15:31.960 --> 15:34.160
I'll bring them to her later myself.

15:34.760 --> 15:35.720
Don't care.

15:35.800 --> 15:38.360
She's stubborn,
always headstrong and reckless.

15:38.960 --> 15:40.480
We're all looking out for her.

15:40.560 --> 15:43.120
No outsider
would play the villain for her.

15:47.240 --> 15:49.120
Yang Xian, you're here.

15:54.160 --> 15:55.040
Perfect timing.

15:55.120 --> 15:57.000
Chunlai, bring a pair of chopsticks.

15:58.400 --> 15:59.240
No need.

16:00.080 --> 16:02.200
I'm not staying.
I just have a few words to say.

16:04.080 --> 16:04.920
Go ahead.

16:05.520 --> 16:08.200
Today, a merchant bought my goods.

16:08.280 --> 16:10.760
He claimed to be short on money
and invited me to his inn.

16:11.360 --> 16:13.760
At the inn, he left to get more money.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.600
To assure me, he left his old mother

16:16.680 --> 16:18.680
and a cart of goods as collateral.

16:18.760 --> 16:20.000
I waited

16:20.080 --> 16:21.400
until sunset,

16:21.480 --> 16:23.160
but he never returned.

16:23.240 --> 16:25.160
After pressing for answers,

16:25.240 --> 16:28.040
I found out the cart was rented,

16:28.120 --> 16:29.280
filled with firewood.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.920
And the "mother"

16:32.000 --> 16:34.600
was just a beggar he hired.

16:35.600 --> 16:37.120
By the time I reached the dock,

16:37.200 --> 16:38.040
his ship was gone,

16:38.120 --> 16:40.840
and so was he.

16:42.640 --> 16:44.080
I came to ask you two,

16:44.720 --> 16:45.800
Lord Du and Lord Fan,

16:46.560 --> 16:48.760
do you know him?

16:50.320 --> 16:52.480
What kind of question is that?

16:52.560 --> 16:53.920
How would we know a con artist?

16:54.520 --> 16:57.280
You were tricked. That's on you.

16:57.360 --> 17:00.160
Instead of reflecting, you blame us?

17:00.240 --> 17:01.960
Did we make you lose money?

17:02.040 --> 17:04.240
Did we force you

17:04.320 --> 17:06.040
into that deal?

17:08.240 --> 17:09.760
He was just anxious.

17:09.840 --> 17:12.640
No need to blame him.

17:12.720 --> 17:14.920
Yang Xian, in business,

17:15.000 --> 17:17.680
con men are common.

17:18.280 --> 17:19.720
How much did you lose this time?

17:19.800 --> 17:21.720
Can you recover it? Did you report it?

17:21.800 --> 17:23.680
No need for this pretense.

17:24.200 --> 17:26.320
Your family gave me ten strings to trade.

17:26.400 --> 17:27.880
I earned 600 coins from lychees.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.520
The conman stole it all

17:29.600 --> 17:32.040
and tricked me into this.

17:32.120 --> 17:33.720
Do you think anyone would go this far?

17:34.440 --> 17:35.480
When we were trading,

17:35.560 --> 17:37.280
I even saw Lord Fan's servant nearby,

17:37.360 --> 17:39.440
lingering across the street.

17:39.520 --> 17:41.680
Is this really just a coincidence?

17:41.760 --> 17:42.600
Madam.

17:44.840 --> 17:46.160
Well, well.

17:47.480 --> 17:49.360
You didn't catch that loser,

17:49.440 --> 17:50.960
but you came back empty-handed?

17:51.040 --> 17:52.960
Were you tricked,

17:53.040 --> 17:54.920
or did you waste it?

17:55.000 --> 17:56.280
Did you squander it all

17:56.360 --> 17:57.640
on gambling and women?

17:57.720 --> 18:00.280
And now you make up lies to fool us?

18:00.360 --> 18:01.600
I wonder if that's the truth.

18:03.120 --> 18:04.280
Yang Xian,

18:04.360 --> 18:06.200
did you really waste it all?

18:07.000 --> 18:09.040
Madam, how could I dare?

18:11.200 --> 18:13.200
Then, how much

18:13.280 --> 18:14.400
of my investment is left?

18:17.560 --> 18:19.800
I took your family in,
hoping you'd change.

18:19.880 --> 18:22.560
I risked my reputation to help you.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.680
I invested in you.

18:24.760 --> 18:27.360
Yet in less than a month,
you spent it all.

18:27.960 --> 18:29.960
How do you still have the face to return?

18:31.600 --> 18:32.680
Yang Xian,

18:32.760 --> 18:34.760
if you misused the money,

18:34.840 --> 18:36.520
just admit it.

18:36.600 --> 18:39.480
Why lie and make her angry?

18:40.440 --> 18:42.120
Shouhua is kind,

18:42.200 --> 18:43.320
but I can't stand this.

18:43.920 --> 18:47.280
The Li family has never
raised a scoundrel.

18:47.360 --> 18:49.840
Leshan is young and sheltered.

18:50.440 --> 18:52.800
How can we entrust her
to someone like you?

18:52.880 --> 18:54.960
You'll ruin the Li family name.

18:55.040 --> 18:57.240
Did you hear that?
If you have any self-respect

18:57.320 --> 18:58.360
and esteem,

18:58.440 --> 19:00.560
leave our home. Don't waste her youth.

19:02.800 --> 19:03.640
Great.

19:04.360 --> 19:06.480
The Li family clearly wants to end this.

19:07.560 --> 19:09.440
Do you remember the bandit attack?

19:09.520 --> 19:11.320
Who's the one

19:11.400 --> 19:13.160
who saved Haode and the old lady?

19:13.760 --> 19:15.600
And months ago, at the family banquet,

19:15.680 --> 19:17.320
who swore

19:17.400 --> 19:20.240
to forgive my past mistakes?

19:21.080 --> 19:23.200
I've made grave errors,

19:23.280 --> 19:25.960
but I've always respected you
like my own mother.

19:26.040 --> 19:27.640
If you wanted me gone,

19:27.720 --> 19:28.760
just say so.

19:29.440 --> 19:30.760
Do you think I'd cling to you?

19:30.840 --> 19:32.960
Why set up the third obstacle

19:33.040 --> 19:34.320
to mock me?

19:35.440 --> 19:36.800
I know I'm not a good man.

19:37.400 --> 19:39.080
But is the Li family's scheming

19:39.160 --> 19:40.720
any better?

19:40.800 --> 19:43.600
You claim to treat me like family,

19:43.680 --> 19:45.720
yet you're dishonest behind my back.

19:45.800 --> 19:47.440
Do you truly feel no shame?

19:47.520 --> 19:48.640
Nonsense.

19:49.760 --> 19:50.960
Enough.

19:52.440 --> 19:55.080
No need to say more. Guards!

19:58.000 --> 19:58.840
No need.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.040
I'll leave on my own.

20:01.120 --> 20:03.880
Even if you invite me back with honor,

20:04.440 --> 20:06.160
I'll never step through this door again.

20:06.240 --> 20:09.240
Yang Xian, my daughter is beautiful

20:09.320 --> 20:10.960
and talented.

20:11.040 --> 20:13.640
Do you think she'll lack suitors?

20:14.600 --> 20:16.280
Remember this.

20:16.360 --> 20:19.160
Once you leave,

20:19.240 --> 20:21.040
from now on,

20:21.120 --> 20:23.760
the connections between Li and Yang
are ended.

20:23.840 --> 20:26.560
The marriage is canceled.
We have no relationship.

20:27.520 --> 20:29.840
Even if you starve,

20:30.520 --> 20:32.200
don't come begging us.

20:54.400 --> 20:55.280
What do you think?

21:12.680 --> 21:13.880
Stop.

21:15.160 --> 21:17.200
Mom, has Yang Xian been here?

21:18.360 --> 21:20.840
He was, but I sent him away.

21:22.480 --> 21:25.480
Mom, keeping your word matters.

21:25.560 --> 21:28.600
Even helping poor relatives,
you shouldn't push them too far.

21:29.400 --> 21:30.800
His one-month deadline isn't up.

21:30.880 --> 21:33.520
Breaking your promise will create enemies.

21:39.840 --> 21:40.960
Shameless.

21:41.040 --> 21:44.000
Ganging up on the weak
shows no compassion at all.

21:44.960 --> 21:46.880
Du Yangxi,
you're the third-ranked scholar,

21:46.960 --> 21:48.560
yet you support such bullying.

21:51.400 --> 21:52.600
Even Leshan has matured now.

21:52.680 --> 21:54.840
She's no longer that bratty girl.

21:54.920 --> 21:56.760
She even knows the drill.

21:58.640 --> 22:00.640
Leshan, here.

22:01.720 --> 22:03.680
Mom must have her reasons

22:03.760 --> 22:05.200
for being so harsh.

22:05.280 --> 22:07.280
Sit down, and I'll explain.

22:20.200 --> 22:23.320
Once, I lived in luxury…

22:25.400 --> 22:27.680
but now, I've lost everything.

22:27.760 --> 22:29.200
This is a dead end.

22:31.480 --> 22:33.160
A person's life

22:34.520 --> 22:36.680
is both laughable and tragic.

23:19.720 --> 23:20.920
What else do you want?

23:22.840 --> 23:25.560
Master Yang,
my master invites you upstairs.

23:32.440 --> 23:34.280
Master Chai, what's the meaning of this?

23:34.360 --> 23:35.760
I have a few heartfelt words.

23:35.840 --> 23:37.920
Every parent wants their daughter

23:38.000 --> 23:41.000
to marry well and live securely.

23:41.600 --> 23:43.200
Madam broke her promise

23:43.280 --> 23:44.840
only for her daughter's life event,

23:44.920 --> 23:46.520
out of love for her daughter.

23:46.600 --> 23:48.160
Please don't hold it against her.

23:48.800 --> 23:51.240
Now, you can't stay in Bianjing.

23:51.320 --> 23:54.640
Take this small amount to return home.

23:54.720 --> 23:56.320
Buy land,

23:56.400 --> 23:59.040
work hard, and stay fed.

23:59.920 --> 24:02.760
One day, when fortunes turn,

24:02.840 --> 24:05.320
you might get back to your old glory.

24:05.400 --> 24:06.920
Why stay here to get despised?

24:11.200 --> 24:12.560
Thank you for your kindness.

24:13.320 --> 24:16.440
I brought this on myself.

24:17.400 --> 24:18.560
I can't blame anyone else.

24:20.600 --> 24:22.560
I have travel funds.

24:22.640 --> 24:24.040
No need for more.

24:25.120 --> 24:26.040
Goodbye.

24:27.560 --> 24:28.840
Don't you want to see Leshan?

24:32.960 --> 24:34.680
Please tell her,

24:35.640 --> 24:37.720
Yang Xian failed in business,

24:37.800 --> 24:39.520
lost everything,

24:40.480 --> 24:41.880
and has no face to say goodbye.

24:43.240 --> 24:46.120
I wish her happiness.

24:47.200 --> 24:50.120
Our marriage is in struggle.
It must be our grudge in the past life.

24:50.800 --> 24:52.280
I just hope that after we part,

24:53.080 --> 24:54.800
she finds someone truly good for her

24:56.280 --> 24:57.720
and lives a life of peace and joy.

24:59.480 --> 25:02.120
Wait. Deqing, hurry.

25:03.400 --> 25:04.480
Hurry up.

25:10.280 --> 25:12.720
This is the real money I will lend to you.

25:13.680 --> 25:15.160
That was a test.

25:15.240 --> 25:17.760
If someone lacks guts and spirit,

25:17.840 --> 25:19.200
they'll waste the money.

25:19.280 --> 25:21.280
Such people aren't worth helping.

25:21.360 --> 25:23.840
Even heroes like Wu Zixu begged.

25:23.920 --> 25:26.160
Han Xin survived on charity.

25:26.240 --> 25:28.880
Even heroes falter, let alone us mortals.

25:28.960 --> 25:31.120
Everyone has tough times, right?

25:31.720 --> 25:34.520
Yang Xian, others may have wronged you,

25:34.600 --> 25:37.120
but Leshan stood up
for you wholeheartedly.

25:37.720 --> 25:39.200
How can you bear to let her down?

25:41.160 --> 25:42.640
Tonight at the docks,

25:42.720 --> 25:44.640
a ship will sail to Quanzhou.

25:44.720 --> 25:48.000
Board it and trade overseas.

25:48.080 --> 25:49.800
You'll make countless profits in a year.

25:50.720 --> 25:52.600
- Master Chai.
- But let me say this first.

25:53.520 --> 25:55.360
The seas are rough,

25:55.440 --> 25:56.920
full of unpredictable risks.

25:59.720 --> 26:02.200
You might not come back alive.

26:02.840 --> 26:05.360
It's your choice to go or not.

26:29.320 --> 26:30.840
If you truly want to help him,

26:30.920 --> 26:32.520
why resort to this approach

26:32.600 --> 26:34.040
and push me to play the middleman?

26:34.960 --> 26:37.160
Shouhua and I discussed it.

26:37.240 --> 26:39.560
Yang Xian was born into privilege.

26:39.640 --> 26:42.160
He spends lavishly
and learns only briefly.

26:42.240 --> 26:43.560
Sustaining goodness is harder.

26:44.280 --> 26:47.520
So, forcing him into business
and letting him fail hard once

26:48.120 --> 26:51.120
will teach him life's hardships.

26:51.200 --> 26:53.640
It'll break his spoiled habits.

26:54.960 --> 26:57.480
Jiang Chaozong vanished
after suing the Yangs.

26:57.560 --> 26:59.480
He's disappeared from Bianjing.

26:59.560 --> 27:01.120
Family's grudge remains unsettled.

27:01.200 --> 27:02.680
He'll never know peace.

27:02.760 --> 27:05.040
How can my sister follow him?

27:05.760 --> 27:06.920
And?

27:07.440 --> 27:09.120
With the capital gifted by us,

27:09.200 --> 27:11.520
if he succeeds in life,

27:11.600 --> 27:13.120
the couple might reunite someday.

27:13.840 --> 27:17.600
If he repeats his foolish past,

27:17.680 --> 27:20.400
the money will mark their end.

27:20.480 --> 27:22.840
We'll then marry Leshan to another.

27:22.920 --> 27:23.960
He can't complain.

27:25.400 --> 27:26.520
Aren't you afraid

27:26.600 --> 27:28.520
he will resent the Li family as enemies?

27:29.280 --> 27:31.440
That's why I asked you

27:31.520 --> 27:33.200
to act as the mediator.

27:33.280 --> 27:35.800
We can advance or retreat as needed.

27:37.480 --> 27:38.320
Clever indeed.

29:17.720 --> 29:20.600
THREE YEARS LATER

29:26.480 --> 29:31.000
SIFU HOUSE

29:55.880 --> 29:57.240
Huizhao left the city again?

29:57.960 --> 30:00.000
He's been summoned to the Northwest.

30:00.080 --> 30:01.720
There's been a major murder case.

30:02.320 --> 30:03.960
It's a matter of great importance.

30:04.040 --> 30:05.400
And he refused to take me along.

30:07.480 --> 30:08.400
Mom.

30:08.920 --> 30:11.720
Why call me back so urgently?
Are you planning to remarry Leshan?

30:13.640 --> 30:17.000
The willows by Bian River
have budded thrice,

30:17.080 --> 30:18.400
but he hasn't returned yet.

30:18.480 --> 30:20.720
Not even a single word from him.

30:20.800 --> 30:22.040
What does he want?

30:22.120 --> 30:25.080
Let my beautiful daughter wait forever?

30:26.360 --> 30:28.320
When Yang Xian

30:28.400 --> 30:30.120
left Bianjing,

30:30.200 --> 30:32.200
he left behind a letter of divorce.

30:32.280 --> 30:34.920
Our families have no ties anymore.

30:37.560 --> 30:40.040
Mom, Leshan wants to keep
her word for him.

30:40.120 --> 30:41.520
She won't follow your instructions.

30:42.120 --> 30:44.560
But Qiongnu isn't promised to anyone yet.

30:44.640 --> 30:46.160
We should plan well for her future.

30:47.120 --> 30:49.320
Qiongnu, come on, tell them.

30:49.960 --> 30:52.440
Mom's picked out hundreds
of matches for me.

30:53.200 --> 30:55.320
They say I'm just an adopted daughter.

30:55.400 --> 30:56.640
They only ask about my dowry.

30:56.720 --> 30:58.400
Even the ones who don't

30:58.480 --> 31:01.560
are after our ties
with the Du and Shen families.

31:02.600 --> 31:05.920
Marrying off just to benefit themselves.

31:06.000 --> 31:08.960
How long would that marriage even last?

31:10.080 --> 31:11.080
So, I told Mom

31:11.880 --> 31:12.840
I'm done.

31:12.920 --> 31:16.200
I'll stay with her and the shop.
I'm not going anywhere.

31:16.800 --> 31:18.520
Got that? Doesn't make any sense.

31:20.000 --> 31:22.160
I raised you six kids all alone

31:22.240 --> 31:24.200
after your father passed.

31:24.280 --> 31:26.520
Not to brag,

31:26.600 --> 31:27.880
but I managed,

31:27.960 --> 31:31.480
unlike those wifeless widowers, who
remarried real fast within three months.

31:31.560 --> 31:33.680
I'm tougher

31:33.760 --> 31:35.360
than any of them.

31:36.480 --> 31:38.040
Running a shop as a widow isn't easy.

31:38.120 --> 31:40.920
Even if you're a tiger,

31:41.000 --> 31:42.800
there are wolves.

31:43.760 --> 31:47.520
Can you fight off a whole pack?

31:48.200 --> 31:50.720
Other Li relatives respect me
because I'm their elder.

31:50.800 --> 31:52.200
They don't dare to go further.

31:52.800 --> 31:54.160
But if I'm gone,

31:54.840 --> 31:57.280
who'll protect you?

31:57.360 --> 32:00.040
They'll take the shop

32:00.120 --> 32:02.240
and harass you.

32:02.320 --> 32:05.840
Even if you have tons of ways to prevent,

32:05.920 --> 32:07.600
you might hold them off now,

32:08.360 --> 32:09.560
but not always.

32:12.440 --> 32:15.600
I've decided when Leshan gets married,

32:17.720 --> 32:18.720
the shop will go to you.

32:19.360 --> 32:22.680
Later, I'll find you a good husband.

32:22.760 --> 32:24.960
We'll have him marry into our family.

32:25.640 --> 32:28.680
Listen, what's wrong with trying?

32:28.760 --> 32:30.880
Picking the right one takes time.

32:30.960 --> 32:33.600
Marriage is for life. We can't rush this.

32:34.200 --> 32:35.600
It has to be perfect, understand?

32:36.640 --> 32:39.800
Mom, leave Leshan to me.

32:39.880 --> 32:41.200
Trust me, I'll handle it.

32:41.920 --> 32:43.920
She's stubborn as a mule.
What will you say?

32:51.600 --> 32:53.560
Shouhua. Shouhua.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.680
- Kangning.
- You're back.

33:02.480 --> 33:03.800
The temple was so lively today.

33:03.880 --> 33:05.840
Didn't you say you've lost your appetite?

33:05.920 --> 33:07.640
I brought you some treats.

33:10.560 --> 33:13.240
There's dried apples and pear slices.

33:13.320 --> 33:15.160
And here's some candied ginger.

33:15.240 --> 33:17.160
Plus green apricot slices.

33:17.240 --> 33:18.280
Go ahead, try them.

33:24.640 --> 33:25.840
Shouhua.

33:26.920 --> 33:29.480
Why are your eyes red?

33:29.560 --> 33:30.920
You should say something to her.

33:31.000 --> 33:33.840
Du Yangxi just got promoted.

33:33.920 --> 33:36.440
You should be overjoyed right now.

33:36.520 --> 33:37.880
But she seems so emotional.

33:38.480 --> 33:40.440
Is he getting restless from his promotion?

33:41.360 --> 33:42.360
If he dares stray,

33:42.440 --> 33:45.040
you'd scratch his face. Let's see
him go to the office like that.

33:45.120 --> 33:48.440
Nonsense. She's pregnant now.
We don't even know it's a girl or boy.

33:48.520 --> 33:51.560
Yet he's already picked hundreds of names.

33:51.640 --> 33:52.880
Unlike my husband,

33:52.960 --> 33:55.600
he still called them Little Chubbies
after they were born.

33:55.680 --> 33:56.960
I'm the one who decides the name.

33:58.760 --> 34:00.560
That's just him being careful.

34:01.840 --> 34:04.960
But if not this, then what's it about?

34:06.600 --> 34:09.000
I was just telling her about Lady Wang.

34:10.480 --> 34:11.880
Her husband left two years ago.

34:12.560 --> 34:16.040
He opened a shop in Xiangzhou
and took a concubine.

34:16.640 --> 34:17.920
Now, he won't return.

34:18.760 --> 34:20.560
Poor Lady Wang.

34:20.640 --> 34:22.680
She was such a capable woman.

34:22.760 --> 34:24.360
Now, she cries her eyes out.

34:24.440 --> 34:26.720
It's heartbreaking to see her.

34:27.880 --> 34:29.480
Men leave to do business

34:29.560 --> 34:30.960
without sending word.

34:31.040 --> 34:33.440
Some start a new life and marry again.

34:33.520 --> 34:36.440
Leaving their wives abandoned at home.

34:37.040 --> 34:38.800
Men's indulgence is excusable,

34:38.880 --> 34:40.840
but women's is judged harshly.

34:40.920 --> 34:41.920
Why?

34:43.240 --> 34:46.320
Sisters, stop beating around the bush.

34:46.400 --> 34:48.920
Did Mom ask you to convince me to remarry?

34:49.680 --> 34:50.880
So you already know.

34:50.960 --> 34:52.520
That fool Yang won't come back.

34:52.600 --> 34:54.080
Who knows where he's nesting now.

34:54.680 --> 34:57.200
Are you going to wait forever? Forget him.

34:57.920 --> 34:59.720
Fine, I'll do it.

35:02.480 --> 35:04.280
We had a pact,

35:04.360 --> 35:06.280
but I've waited for him for three years.

35:06.360 --> 35:08.360
I've done my duty.

35:08.440 --> 35:10.440
If Mom wants me to remarry, I will.

35:12.880 --> 35:15.240
But how I marry

35:15.320 --> 35:17.960
and to whom is my choice.

35:19.000 --> 35:20.120
Marriage

35:20.200 --> 35:22.840
isn't just about match meetings.
What else?

35:24.600 --> 35:26.440
Embroidered ball toss.

35:27.080 --> 35:28.520
Everyone, please listen.

35:28.600 --> 35:30.560
The Li family runs a teahouse here.

35:30.640 --> 35:32.800
They're considered a well-off family.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.480
Their only gem of a daughter

35:34.560 --> 35:36.400
has never been allowed to step out.

35:37.120 --> 35:39.440
Speaking of her,

35:39.520 --> 35:41.400
she's not only beautiful

35:41.480 --> 35:43.000
but virtuous and kind.

35:43.080 --> 35:44.360
Her needlework is impeccable.

35:44.440 --> 35:47.040
She excels at managing the household.

35:48.360 --> 35:49.880
My mother-in-law has decided

35:49.960 --> 35:51.680
this time, the Li's will choose a groom.

35:51.760 --> 35:53.520
No matter his family or wealth.

35:53.600 --> 35:55.040
The dowry doesn't matter.

35:55.120 --> 35:58.080
They seek someone talented and handsome.

35:58.160 --> 36:00.000
A kind and virtuous son-in-law.

36:00.080 --> 36:02.440
Someone to pair perfectly with her.

36:02.520 --> 36:06.000
- Wonderful!
- Just wonderful!

36:06.080 --> 36:07.720
- That's good.
- Great.

36:09.920 --> 36:11.320
This is really something.

36:11.400 --> 36:13.560
What's this here?

36:13.640 --> 36:15.480
This is such a treasure.

36:15.560 --> 36:17.240
- This is a pearl canopy.
- This

36:17.320 --> 36:19.200
is part of her wedding dowry.

36:19.280 --> 36:21.240
This canopy must be worth thousands.

36:21.320 --> 36:22.600
You've got no idea, do you?

36:22.680 --> 36:25.000
Eastside's Mr. Zhang paid 100,000 strings

36:25.080 --> 36:27.240
just for a pearl quilt for his daughter.

36:27.320 --> 36:28.880
This is truly priceless.

36:28.960 --> 36:30.000
Li Leshan?

36:30.600 --> 36:32.000
Wasn't it on her wedding day

36:32.080 --> 36:33.160
when Yang kidnapped her?

36:34.160 --> 36:35.280
She's such a beauty.

36:35.360 --> 36:37.880
Her husband's family got in trouble,
but she stayed with them.

36:37.960 --> 36:39.760
Such love and devotion are rare!

36:39.840 --> 36:41.880
- You must covet the pearl quilt.
- This pearl canopy

36:41.960 --> 36:43.680
looks a bit familiar.

36:43.760 --> 36:46.800
The Li's bring it out
for every daughter's wedding.

36:46.880 --> 36:49.120
Are we digging up old stories again?

36:49.720 --> 36:50.760
To me,

36:50.840 --> 36:53.080
my wife outshines the moon itself.

36:53.160 --> 36:56.040
No pearl canopy is worth
more than my wife.

36:56.920 --> 36:58.920
Stop joking around. Hurry up.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.320
PAN RESTAURANT

37:02.400 --> 37:04.600
Ladies and gentlemen.

37:04.680 --> 37:05.840
We've agreed beforehand

37:05.920 --> 37:08.080
that anyone joining the contest

37:08.160 --> 37:11.160
must register here within three days.

37:11.240 --> 37:13.240
We need to check first

37:13.320 --> 37:15.160
if their age and looks match

37:15.240 --> 37:17.000
and if they're truly talented.

37:17.080 --> 37:18.880
They must pass an initial screening.

37:18.960 --> 37:20.400
Not just anyone can join

37:20.480 --> 37:22.280
to snatch the Li family's ball.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.400
- Let me.
- I want that.

37:23.480 --> 37:25.040
- I'll go.
- I want to register.

37:25.120 --> 37:26.040
- Let me first!
- Let me.

37:26.120 --> 37:27.080
- One by one.
- Okay.

37:27.160 --> 37:28.640
- One by one.
- Don't rush.

37:28.720 --> 37:29.640
Slow down, everyone.

37:29.720 --> 37:32.600
When the Yangs fell,
Grandpa locked me up for three months.

37:32.680 --> 37:34.240
I couldn't do a thing to help.

37:34.320 --> 37:36.280
Now you want to marry my sister-in-law.

37:36.360 --> 37:39.520
I'll make sure it's all for nothing.

37:39.600 --> 37:41.440
- Let's go.
- Don't push.

37:50.080 --> 37:51.840
It's still early.

37:52.480 --> 37:54.400
I'm just here to set a bracelet.

37:54.480 --> 37:56.000
Do you have to follow me every step?

37:56.920 --> 37:58.200
Afraid I'll get lost?

37:58.280 --> 37:59.400
Exactly.

38:00.040 --> 38:01.640
It's the big day for the ball toss.

38:02.560 --> 38:05.640
Mom knew you'd slack, so she sent me.

38:06.880 --> 38:09.680
I gave my word. Would I go back on it?

38:10.920 --> 38:12.280
Don't underestimate me.

38:22.000 --> 38:23.120
Stop the cart! Stop!

38:23.200 --> 38:24.520
Hold on! Stop for a bit.

38:25.440 --> 38:26.480
What's wrong?

38:29.400 --> 38:30.320
Be careful.

38:32.120 --> 38:34.480
Go to the Pan Restaurant first.
I'll follow.

38:34.560 --> 38:36.120
Don't worry, I won't be late.

38:37.000 --> 38:39.040
- Keep up.
- Sure.

38:39.120 --> 38:40.080
My lady.

38:42.440 --> 38:43.560
My lady.

38:47.040 --> 38:49.640
My lady, what are you staring at?

38:52.760 --> 38:53.680
GUO'S TEAHOUSE

38:55.720 --> 38:57.320
Just a silly dog.

39:04.600 --> 39:05.560
Let's go.

39:15.440 --> 39:18.640
No need to hide. Your wife's gone far.

39:23.480 --> 39:25.440
How do you know she's my wife?

39:25.520 --> 39:28.280
If not, why act like she's a tiger?

39:28.360 --> 39:30.120
And she's too young

39:30.200 --> 39:31.200
to be your mother.

39:32.280 --> 39:33.800
You are no master in your house.

39:34.800 --> 39:36.000
Mind your mouth!

39:36.080 --> 39:37.520
Guests are here. Go help out.

39:37.600 --> 39:39.480
- Ow, ow, ow!
- Please, take a seat.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.360
You, come here.

39:42.320 --> 39:44.200
Gentle, please! Easy, my wife!

39:44.280 --> 39:45.600
Get to work.

39:48.160 --> 39:49.160
That table.

39:50.400 --> 39:51.480
Here's your snack.

39:52.080 --> 39:53.000
Enjoy.

39:54.760 --> 39:57.000
I heard all about you from Qiansheng.

39:57.080 --> 39:59.680
No wonder my sworn brother

39:59.760 --> 40:00.920
was so restless

40:01.000 --> 40:03.080
on the way back.

40:05.000 --> 40:06.440
The snobs of the Li family

40:06.520 --> 40:09.120
must be drowning in shame now.

40:09.760 --> 40:10.760
Now you're back,

40:10.840 --> 40:12.680
why not flaunt your success at their door?

40:12.760 --> 40:13.880
Why hide instead?

40:14.520 --> 40:17.440
Back then, the bundle

40:17.520 --> 40:19.680
had more than silver.
Clothes, snacks, and shoes.

40:20.360 --> 40:23.240
Master Chai was kind, but this thoughtful?

40:23.880 --> 40:26.040
How could he help me against Li Kangning?

40:26.120 --> 40:29.680
Clearly, my mother-in-law was pushing me.

40:29.760 --> 40:32.720
Then, you should've gone
to the Li's sooner.

40:32.800 --> 40:35.240
Bring her back and enjoy life. Why hide?

40:36.200 --> 40:37.200
What do you know?

40:38.080 --> 40:39.000
Look at me now.

40:39.080 --> 40:41.600
I'm dusty, unkempt, a mess.

40:41.680 --> 40:43.600
Thin, dark, and ugly.

40:43.680 --> 40:45.360
How can I face her like this?

40:46.200 --> 40:49.960
It's been three years.
The house is a wreck.

40:50.040 --> 40:51.680
I need to fix it up properly first.

40:52.200 --> 40:53.600
Then I can bring her home.

40:56.480 --> 41:00.320
So, you're just nervous about going back?

41:00.400 --> 41:01.600
Yet you dare scold me.

41:01.680 --> 41:03.000
What did you say?

41:07.080 --> 41:09.680
Master, I found Jiang Chaozong's location.

41:11.400 --> 41:12.440
Go back.

41:20.680 --> 41:23.360
If you can't see my sister-in-law, I will.

41:26.400 --> 41:27.480
Madam,

41:28.120 --> 41:29.640
how do I get to Sifu House?

41:30.480 --> 41:32.160
Turn right at the next intersection.

41:32.800 --> 41:34.000
Thanks.

41:37.040 --> 41:38.600
PAN RESTAURANT

41:42.440 --> 41:43.480
Today's ball

41:43.560 --> 41:44.840
must be mine.

41:44.920 --> 41:46.080
I've heard

41:46.160 --> 41:47.600
that lady from the Li family,

41:47.680 --> 41:49.200
she's really beautiful.

41:49.280 --> 41:50.240
She's definitely mine.

41:50.320 --> 41:51.960
The ball toss is definitely mine.

41:52.040 --> 41:53.800
I've said it. It's mine for sure.

41:55.600 --> 41:56.440
Everything's ready.

41:56.520 --> 41:58.680
Madam wants to match with the Chen family.

41:58.760 --> 42:00.360
I think the ball toss

42:00.440 --> 42:01.760
is in his hands for sure.

42:01.840 --> 42:03.320
Look, it's that one.

42:05.080 --> 42:06.000
It's definitely mine.

42:06.080 --> 42:08.360
- Must be mine.
- Dream on.

42:08.440 --> 42:10.520
Remember,

42:10.600 --> 42:12.360
don't let the Chen family take it.

42:12.440 --> 42:13.280
Sure.

42:16.000 --> 42:17.600
Watch out for Zhao.

42:20.760 --> 42:21.600
Got it.

42:24.160 --> 42:25.240
What happened?

42:25.320 --> 42:26.480
Where's Li Leshan?

42:26.560 --> 42:28.120
Why is she taking so long?

42:28.200 --> 42:29.840
- Exactly, exactly.
- That's right.

42:29.920 --> 42:31.920
- Come.
- Come in!

42:32.000 --> 42:34.960
- Let us see!
- Come!

42:35.040 --> 42:35.920
Hurry up!

42:36.000 --> 42:37.120
- She's coming.
- Coming!

42:39.400 --> 42:40.280
Leshan, give me!

42:40.360 --> 42:42.600
- Throw it this way.
- Leshan!

42:42.680 --> 42:44.800
- I want the ball!
- Give me!

42:44.880 --> 42:46.360
This way! This way!

42:46.440 --> 42:49.240
Leshan is late. Sorry,
but could you stand in for her?

42:49.320 --> 42:50.840
Make sure to throw it to the target.

42:50.920 --> 42:52.800
The one with the green peony on the hat.

42:52.880 --> 42:55.400
- My lady, throw it to me.
- Here!

42:55.480 --> 42:57.880
- Give me!
- Throw it this way!

42:58.440 --> 43:01.600
- Leshan, give me!
- Toss this way!

43:02.480 --> 43:04.320
Lady, throw it to me!

43:04.400 --> 43:05.280
Put it on.

43:07.000 --> 43:07.840
Throw it here.

43:08.440 --> 43:10.160
What's going on?

43:10.240 --> 43:11.720
Isn't this just causing trouble?

43:14.600 --> 43:16.280
- Throw it this way.
- Over here.

43:18.720 --> 43:20.960
Why are there so many
with peonies on their hats?

43:21.560 --> 43:24.640
A good match must be the highest man.

43:26.480 --> 43:28.800
Here! Hurry, give it to me.

43:38.000 --> 43:39.280
- That's mine!
- Don't grab!

43:39.360 --> 43:40.960
What are you grabbing?

43:45.800 --> 43:47.080
Mine!

43:47.160 --> 43:48.640
- That's mine!
- Take it!

43:58.000 --> 43:59.440
Don't push!

44:04.360 --> 44:06.320
- The ball!
- It's over!

44:06.400 --> 44:08.560
How do I explain this to my wife, cousin?

44:08.640 --> 44:09.560
Stop it, hurry up!

44:09.640 --> 44:11.480
- Deqing.
- Let's go.

44:13.560 --> 44:15.200
Did a person take it,

44:15.280 --> 44:16.120
or did a dog?

44:16.200 --> 44:18.040
What's going on? Who's courting?

44:18.120 --> 44:18.960
What if it's the dog?

44:19.040 --> 44:20.120
Li Leshan of Sifu House.

44:20.200 --> 44:21.680
The dog took her ball toss.

44:21.760 --> 44:23.040
That's a huge joke.

44:23.120 --> 44:24.600
- That's so embarrassing.
- What?

44:24.680 --> 44:26.800
Li Leshan of Sifu House.

44:26.880 --> 44:28.560
Her ball toss was taken by a dog.

44:43.480 --> 44:44.560
I'm the winner!

44:45.560 --> 44:48.200
Whoever holds the ball toss
owns the bride and the pearl canopy.

44:48.280 --> 44:50.720
Don't let him get it. Grab it back.

45:11.200 --> 45:12.320
Brother,

45:12.400 --> 45:14.360
the capital is something else.

45:14.440 --> 45:16.920
It's much livelier than our hometown.

45:17.000 --> 45:18.880
Let's go. Don't keep Mother waiting.

45:21.840 --> 45:22.680
PAN RESTAURANT

45:22.760 --> 45:24.160
Don't push!

45:26.040 --> 45:26.920
I got it!

45:27.000 --> 45:27.960
PAN RESTAURANT

45:38.640 --> 45:39.840
What?

46:06.800 --> 46:09.240
I'm Chai An, owner of this Pan Restaurant.

46:09.840 --> 46:11.800
Today,
I'm finding a husband for my sister.

46:11.880 --> 46:14.360
May I ask your name, sir?

46:15.120 --> 46:18.120
Brother,
they want you as their son-in-law!

46:22.160 --> 46:24.440
What a fickle

46:24.520 --> 46:26.800
and unreliable Li Leshan.

46:28.480 --> 46:31.360
Fair-faced, but no manners.

46:31.440 --> 46:33.040
He's clearly a reckless man.

46:41.160 --> 46:42.200
Master.

46:42.280 --> 46:44.440
I've been searching for him everywhere.

46:45.600 --> 46:48.200
But it's like he's vanished, no clue.

46:48.720 --> 46:51.560
Someone said they saw him nearby.

46:51.640 --> 46:54.680
After much searching, I finally found out.

46:55.280 --> 46:57.480
He's already joined the Cui family

46:57.560 --> 46:59.560
and became a servant in their house.

47:02.200 --> 47:04.080
The senior official

47:04.160 --> 47:06.280
and the current adviser, Cui Weizhi?

47:06.360 --> 47:09.720
Yes, since he joined Cui's side,

47:09.800 --> 47:11.240
he's rarely showed his face.

47:11.840 --> 47:14.680
He's been secretly visiting beauties.

47:14.760 --> 47:15.800
That's how we found him.

47:17.320 --> 47:20.440
To avoid danger, he's been very clever.

47:21.760 --> 47:22.680
Know what to do?

47:23.400 --> 47:24.240
Yes, Master.

49:55.040 --> 49:57.880
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
